[
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 12.04,
    "end": 17.04,
    "transcript": "One thing that's really consistent with the people that I've photographed is that I have a connection with them."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 17.04,
    "end": 20.04,
    "transcript": "I see myself in them in some way."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 20.04,
    "end": 25.04,
    "transcript": "I have to feel some sort of chemistry in order to evoke an image that I love."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 25.04,
    "end": 37.82,
    "transcript": "I'm creating a series of portraits that is trying to redefine what it means to be queer in America today."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 37.82,
    "end": 40.82,
    "transcript": "Usually it starts with an email or a Facebook message."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 40.82,
    "end": 42.82,
    "transcript": "You can't really walk up to somebody on the street and be like,"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 42.82,
    "end": 45.82,
    "transcript": "Hey, can I shoot you for my big gay project?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 45.82,
    "end": 48.82,
    "transcript": "But on the internet, if people are putting themselves out there super publicly,"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 48.82,
    "end": 53.82,
    "transcript": "then I think it's a pretty safe bet that they really are seeking visibility in a bigger way."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 54.82,
    "end": 59.82,
    "transcript": "So Aaron Riley is the CEO and founder of New Leaf Columbus,"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 59.82,
    "end": 63.82,
    "transcript": "which I'm thinking might be pretty new because it doesn't have any likes yet."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 63.82,
    "end": 64.82,
    "transcript": "I'm going to like it right now."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 64.82,
    "end": 67.82,
    "transcript": "I found him by searching for queer Columbus, Ohio."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 67.82,
    "end": 70.82,
    "transcript": "He looked so different with his suit and tie than a lot of people that were featured."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 70.82,
    "end": 72.82,
    "transcript": "I immediately was drawn to him."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 72.82,
    "end": 83.92,
    "transcript": "I tell them to take me somewhere that's meaningful for them."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 83.92,
    "end": 87.92,
    "transcript": "Where they can show both strength of individuality and vulnerability at the same time."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 87.92,
    "end": 90.92,
    "transcript": "These are the two walls that I call my wall of shame."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 90.92,
    "end": 91.92,
    "transcript": "Totally."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 91.92,
    "end": 94.92,
    "transcript": "It's that shame of self-promotion, you know."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 94.92,
    "end": 99.92,
    "transcript": "Some of my places I've been, accomplishments, achievements, whatever you want to call it."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 99.92,
    "end": 102.92,
    "transcript": "Alright, trusty camera."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 102.92,
    "end": 107.92,
    "transcript": "So this film case I actually got from my uncle, which is why it says my name already on it."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 107.92,
    "end": 110.92,
    "transcript": "So, it's a 4x5 land camera."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 110.92,
    "end": 112.92,
    "transcript": "And..."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 112.92,
    "end": 115.92,
    "transcript": "Let's see if I can open it smoothly."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 115.92,
    "end": 117.92,
    "transcript": "Probably not."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 117.92,
    "end": 130.33,
    "transcript": "Even this process is kind of calming to me."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 130.33,
    "end": 134.33,
    "transcript": "It's calming setting it up."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 134.33,
    "end": 140.33,
    "transcript": "And I also think that it lends to a different sort of photo shoot and one that I really want."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 140.33,
    "end": 146.18,
    "transcript": "I love this idea of formal portraiture that kind of has..."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 146.18,
    "end": 148.18,
    "transcript": "I feel like it's almost going by the wayside."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 148.18,
    "end": 151.18,
    "transcript": "This idea of just sitting and presenting yourself in this really conscious way."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 151.18,
    "end": 153.18,
    "transcript": "When people see like a digital portrait,"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 153.18,
    "end": 156.18,
    "transcript": "like a digital 35mm or something,"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 156.18,
    "end": 157.18,
    "transcript": "they know exactly how to act."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 157.18,
    "end": 159.18,
    "transcript": "They know what faces to put on."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 159.18,
    "end": 162.18,
    "transcript": "When they see this, it's like a different sort of beast."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 162.18,
    "end": 165.18,
    "transcript": "They just get really calm in front of it."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 165.18,
    "end": 167.18,
    "transcript": "Her name's Chickadee."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 167.18,
    "end": 172.18,
    "transcript": "I was really interested in her because she lived in concrete Washington,"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 172.18,
    "end": 176.18,
    "transcript": "which is the last place on earth I thought I would find a queer subject."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 176.18,
    "end": 177.18,
    "transcript": "She was really willing."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 177.18,
    "end": 182.18,
    "transcript": "She's like, I have two kids and a husband and this woman who's our mutual sweetheart."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 183.18,
    "end": 189.3,
    "transcript": "This is Travis in Glendale, California at Gay Skate."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 189.3,
    "end": 192.3,
    "transcript": "And you can see this light blur right here,"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 192.3,
    "end": 195.3,
    "transcript": "which is a band of super fast roller skating drag queens"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 195.3,
    "end": 197.3,
    "transcript": "zooming around in the background behind him."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 197.3,
    "end": 199.7,
    "transcript": "I love his look."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 199.7,
    "end": 201.7,
    "transcript": "I think it also talks about looking for love"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 201.7,
    "end": 204.7,
    "transcript": "and this classic sort of teenage like trying to find, you know,"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 204.7,
    "end": 206.7,
    "transcript": "who to roller skate with."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 206.7,
    "end": 212.18,
    "transcript": "Real strength and real tenderness at the same time in one frame"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 212.18,
    "end": 219.47,
    "transcript": "is something that I go back to a lot in queer relationships."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 219.47,
    "end": 221.47,
    "transcript": "There's so many times that it's so challenging."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 221.47,
    "end": 222.47,
    "transcript": "You're tender and soft,"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 222.47,
    "end": 224.47,
    "transcript": "but also you have to have so much strength to show yourself"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 224.47,
    "end": 229.42,
    "transcript": "and to be who you are."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 229.42,
    "end": 230.42,
    "transcript": "Sometimes I think it's insane."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 230.42,
    "end": 234.42,
    "transcript": "Why did I choose a project that covers a huge community in a huge country?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 234.42,
    "end": 239.42,
    "transcript": "But every time I meet someone, it gives me energy and fuel."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 239.42,
    "end": 242.42,
    "transcript": "It could be a project that ends in a couple months"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 242.42,
    "end": 244.42,
    "transcript": "or I could see it carrying on my entire life"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 244.42,
    "end": 247.42,
    "transcript": "and just changing as the community changes."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 247.42,
    "end": 249.42,
    "transcript": "Okay, so just look straight into the camera."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 249.42,
    "end": 250.42,
    "transcript": "Just relax."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
    "start": 250.42,
    "end": 253.42,
    "transcript": "Take a deep breath and I'll count to three."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00155",
